BAUX session management and immortal terminal environment.

BAUX (Badlandz Auxiliary UniX) provides a persistent, distributed terminal
environment with immortal tmux sessions, intelligent pane resurrection,
and cross-device session synchronization.

Features:
- Immortal tmux sessions that survive disconnects
- Automatic pane respawning on exit
- Cross-device session synchronization
- Anti-nesting detection for SSH sessions
- Integrated with BAUX mesh networking

